<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian 56-day T-bills sell at average 11.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Nigerian 56-day T-bills sell at average 11.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigerian treasury bill sales at weekly auction on Friday as announced by the Central Bank on Monday:</p>
<p>    AUCTION DATE			Aug 8	  Aug 1</p>
<p>    TENOR				 56 days	42 days</p>
<p>    AMOUNT SOLD (million naira)   4,692	  510</p>
<p>    BIDS (million naira)	    4,492	  510</p>
<p>    WEIGHTED AVERAGE RATE	   11.8034	11.8000 pct</p>
<p>    TRUE YIELD			  12.0175	11.9627 pct</p>
<p>($1=83 naira)</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
